{"id":609,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield"],"text":"In homes illuminated by Chandelure instead of lights, funerals were a constant occurrence— or so it’s said."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"This Pokémon haunts dilapidated mansions. It sways its arms to hypnotize opponents with the ominous dancing of its flames."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Y","White 2","Black 2"],"text":"The spirits burned up in its ominous flame lose their way and wander this world forever."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","X","White"],"text":"Being consumed in Chandelure’s flame burns up the spirit, leaving the body behind."},{"games":["Black"],"text":"It absorbs a spirit, which it then burns. By waving the flames on its arms, it puts its foes into a hypnotic trance."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Flash Fire","hidden":false,"description":"If hit by a Fire-type move, the Pokémon absorbs the flames and uses them to power up its own Fire-type moves."},{"name":"Flame Body","hidden":false,"description":"Contact with the Pokémon may burn the attacker."},{"name":"Infiltrator","hidden":true,"description":"The Pokémon's moves are unaffected by the target's barriers, substitutes, and the like."}],"eggGroups":["Amorphous"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":20,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium slow","habitat":null,"color":"Black","shape":"Arms","evolution":{"id":607,"name":"Litwick","condition":null,"children":[{"id":608,"name":"Lampent","condition":"Lv. 41","children":[{"id":609,"name":"Chandelure","condition":"Use Dusk Stone","children":[]}]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[1,52],[1,83],[1,101],[1,107],[1,109],[1,123],[1,174],[1,220],[1,247],[1,261],[1,262],[1,286],[1,310],[1,315],[1,506],[1,517]],"machine":[807,347,109,174,399,203,412,263,126,83,488,53,394,416,114,257,506,63,286,808,101,315,220,809,182,244,94,156,247,806,214,76,180,164,241,269,915,851,168,885,271,433,261],"egg":[151,499,114,471],"tutor":[]},"cards":[{"id":"me55-137","name":"Chandelure","set":"30th Celebration","date":"2026-09-16","rarity":"